<title>USA: Southern's Georgia Power redeeming preferred.</title>
<headline>Southern's Georgia Power redeeming preferred.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Georgia Power Co said Friday it will redeem on August 18 all outstanding shares of its $1.9375 Class A Preferred Stock at the redemption price of $25 per share plus accrued dividends of $0.25295.</p>
<p>Georgia Power is a Southern Co subsidiary.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
